{"id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-numeral.md","title":"数字 overline-n","display":"df-numeral — 数字 overline-n","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-numeral","aliases":["91-df-numeral","91-df-number-term"],"display":"df-numeral — 数字 overline-n","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-numeral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-numeral</span><span>91-df-number-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeral — 数字 overline-n"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-numeral-—-数字-$\\overline{n}$\">df-numeral — 数字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n}\">\\(\\overline{n}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}_0\">\\(\\mathcal{L}_0\\)</span> (基础语言, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (后继函数符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> (零常量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> (基础语言项谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{num}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}(0)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}(n+1)=S(\\operatorname{num}(n)),\n\\qquad\n\\overline n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{num}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}(0)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}(n+1)=S(\\operatorname{num}(n)),\n\\qquad\n\\overline n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\overline n=S^n(0)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\overline n=S^n(0)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n}\">\\(\\overline{n}\\)</span> : 数字（numeral，自然数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>的形式表示）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n\">\\(S^n\\)</span> : 后继函数的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>次迭代</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}\\)</span> : 项谓词</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：数字<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n}\">\\(\\overline{n}\\)</span>是自然数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>在形式语言中的标准表示。通过后继函数的迭代，每个自然数对应一个标准项。</p>\n<p>数字的作用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接元理论自然数与形式语言项</li>\n<li>真理归纳中用数字<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{n}\">\\(\\overline{n}\\)</span>表示&quot;对所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>&quot;</li>\n<li>反射原理中用数字编码句子实例</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理理论中的关键应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\;T(\\ulcorner \\varphi(\\overline{n}) \\urcorner)\">\\(\\forall n\\;T(\\ulcorner \\varphi(\\overline{n}) \\urcorner)\\)</span>表达&quot;对所有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(n)\">\\(\\varphi(n)\\)</span>是真的&quot;</li>\n<li>真理归纳规则：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\;T(\\ulcorner \\varphi(\\overline{n}) \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\forall x\\, \\varphi(x) \\urcorner)\">\\(\\forall n\\;T(\\ulcorner \\varphi(\\overline{n}) \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\forall x\\, \\varphi(x) \\urcorner)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>与 Gödel 编码的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 是对象语言的项，而\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\)</span> 在元语言中是一个自然数。</li>\n<li>对象语言中的真理谓词必须接受一个项；严格写法是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>，即接受“公式编码的数字”。\n通常把它简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\overline n)\">\\(\\varphi(\\overline n)\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 则作为公式的对象语言参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-numeral-—-数字-$\\overline{n}$","text":"df-numeral — 数字 $\\overline{n}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\overline{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}_0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{num}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}(0)=0,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}(n+1)=S(\\operatorname{num}(n)),\n\\qquad\n\\overline n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\overline n=S^n(0)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_0}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\overline{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal{L}_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\;T(\\ulcorner \\varphi(\\overline{n}) \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\;T(\\ulcorner \\varphi(\\overline{n}) \\urcorner) \\to T(\\ulcorner \\forall x\\, \\varphi(x) \\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\overline n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false}],"bytes":2075,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8841d990db08f7a2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":